# What must never be uploaded.
#
# vercel deploy uploads the working directory, not the git tree, so anything
# gitignored is still a candidate. standard-reserve-explainer-prompt.md is
# deliberately kept out of the public repo and must stay out of the deployment
# too. The other build prompts describe unbuilt work and internal instruction,
# and the test harnesses are not part of the site.

